{"book":"mosiah","heading":{"en":"King Laman dies—His people are wild and ferocious and believe in false traditions—Zeniff and his people prevail against them. About 187–160 B.C.","sm":"Ua oti le tupu o Lamana—Ua 'aivao ma fe'ai ma talitonu ona tagata i uputuu sese—Ua manumalo Senifa ma lona nuu e faasaga ia te i latou. E tusa o le 187–160 T.L.M.","words":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"dies","sm":"oti"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"King Laman—","sm":"Lamana—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"'aivao"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"are wild and ferocious","sm":"fe'ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"talitonu"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"and his people believe","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"uputuu"},{"en":"in false traditions—","sm":"sese—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"manumalo"},{"en":"Zeniff prevails","sm":"Senifa"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"lona"},{"en":"and his people","sm":"nuu"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"against","sm":"faasaga"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"them.","sm":"latou."},{"en":"·","sm":"E"},{"en":"·","sm":"tusa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"about","sm":"le"},{"en":"187–160","sm":"187–160"},{"en":"B.C.","sm":"T.L.M."}]},"num":10,"verses":[{"en":"And it came to pass that we again began to establish the kingdom and we again began to possess the land in peace. And I caused that there should be weapons of war made of every kind, that thereby I might have weapons for my people against the time the Lamanites should come up again to war against my people.","n":1,"sm":"Ma sa oo ina amata ona matou toe faatuina le malo ma amata ona toe fai mo matou le laueleele i le filemu. Ma sa ou faia ia tatau ona i ai ni ’auupega o taua o ituaiga eseese e fausia, ina ia mafai ona ia te au ni ’auupega mo lo’u nuu auā le taimi e toe o mai ai sa Lamanā e faasagatau mai i lo’u nuu.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"oo"},{"