rrows, and with swords, and with cimeters, and with stones, and with slings; and they had their heads shaved that they were naked; and they were girded with a leathern girdle about their loins.","n":8,"sm":"Ma sa oo ina latou o a’e i luga i le itu i matu o le laueleele o Seloma, ma a latou autau e toatele, o tane ua faa’auupegaina i aufana, ma ufanafana, ma pelu, ma simetea, ma ma’a, ma ma’ata; ma sa latou tafi o latou ulu sa lē ufiufia i latou; ma sa latou suluina se fusi pa’u manu faataamilo i o latou sulugatiti.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"oo"},{"en":"And it came to pass that","sm":"ina"},{"en":"they","sm":"latou"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"came up","sm":"a’e"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"upon","sm":"luga"},{"en":"to","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"itu"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"of the north,","sm":"matu"},{"en":"of","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the land","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of Shilom,","sm":"Seloma,"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"latou"},{"en":"their hosts","sm":"autau"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"numerous;","sm":"toatele,"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of men,","sm":"tane"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"armed","sm":"faa’auupegaina"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"with bows,","sm":"aufana,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"and with arrows,","sm":"ufanafana,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"and with swords,","sm":"pelu,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"and with cimeters,","sm":"simetea,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"and with stones,","sm":"ma’a,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"and with slings;","sm":"ma’ata;"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"latou"},{"en":"and they shaved","sm":"tafi"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"latou"},{"en":"their heads,","sm":"ulu"},{"en":"","sm":"sa"},{"en":"","sm":"lē"},{"en":"","sm":"ufiufia"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"they","sm":"latou;"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"latou"},{"en":